{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/272078-playing-an-evil-scion","id":272078,"title":"Playing an \"evil\" Scion?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-03T23:54:20-07:00","id":272078,"title":"Playing an \"evil\" Scion?","content":"I'm interested in the Scion universe and have been considering buying the game, because the idea of being able to bench press a continent in a table top game is new to me. But I'm curious if there is a way for Scions to take on an &quot;evil&quot; role without joining the Titans.<br /> <br /> <br /> Specifically:<br /> <br /> Demanding ritual sacrifices.<br /> <br /> Causing destruction on a mass scale.<br /> <br /> Olympian magnitudes of acting like a jerk. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Let's face it, the old gods had a tendency to over react to slight insults, and be dicks to people for no discernible reason. Is this stuff permitted in the game, or would this get you labeled as a traitor?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T01:07:48-07:00","id":272103,"title":"","content":"Nope, totally acceptable in many Pantheons. The Gods don't care much about modern morality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T01:46:36-07:00","id":272114,"title":"","content":"Well this sounds fun! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T02:51:49-07:00","id":272126,"title":"","content":"Olympian magnitudes of Jerkness? Well, in the main game I run the adopted Scion of Hera orchestrated the assassination of Zeus, the rise of Greece as a major world power, the near destruction of a Elohim PC's city, and the death of Ba'al and he's seen as one of the movers and shakers of the world. He's got the Charisma to make all of his ideas feel like they're good enough to work and likes to use proxies. So many proxies.<br /> <br /> Being 'evil' is acceptable in Scion so long as the group you're with approves of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","name":"Aynie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T16:21:59-07:00","id":272560,"title":"","content":"Nice. I was asking because I wanted to know how players might react if in mid quest, one of the Scions finds out their mortals are being harassed and decides the best way to resolve the situation is to claim the antagonist's daughter as a pet. So he turns her into a rabbit, before whisking her away to the Overworld. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Then, of course, there's that list of Asgard Dick Moves that can provide further inspiration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-04-2014, 07:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T09:34:22-07:00","id":273927,"title":"","content":"How players will react is completely up to them. If you start screwing with players and not just the game world it's an entirely different ballgame. don't expect &quot;but it's acceptable in the rules&quot; to save you. Sure, turning their girlfriend into a bunny is acceptable in the rules. So is chopping off your head for being an asshole. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some online tools, including a Scion/Exalted battle wheel? <a href=\"http://rpg-tools.org/generators/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://rpg-tools.org/generators/index.php</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/829-james-mcmurray","name":"James McMurray","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T10:37:59-07:00","id":274023,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>James McMurray</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/272078-playing-an-evil-scion?p=273927#post273927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How players will react is completely up to them. If you start screwing with players and not just the game world it's an entirely different ballgame. don't expect &quot;but it's acceptable in the rules&quot; to save you. Sure, turning their girlfriend into a bunny is acceptable in the rules. So is chopping off your head for being an asshole. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Pfft, why not tie them to a rock and torment them with a flock of pidgeons every day? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T12:46:25-07:00","id":274118,"title":"","content":"Yeah I'm with James there, if I were playing and someone were to turn my girlfriend into a bunny (Which by the way, lamest way to be evil ever), I'd out evil him, tie him up, force feed him a bunch of water than drop'em naked into a tub, than drop a bunch of Candiru in there for a while.<br /> <br /> For folks who haven't seen The Rundown a Candiru is a very small fish that is attracted to your urine, when you pee in the water it swims up into your penis and due to micro-barbs along the body it gets stuck. The only way to remove it is surgery, if it gets far enough up in there that surgery becomes amputation. The real &quot;fun&quot; here is that until it is either removed or it dies, it is a small fish with barbs, stuck in your penis and wiggling around trying to free itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T15:22:09-07:00","id":274193,"title":"","content":"And that is why I don't visit the amazon! And even if I did, I'd swing my hips while I pee, so it doesn't have anything to swim up!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T15:55:23-07:00","id":274226,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't pee in the water&quot; definitely has a different context there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T00:08:04-07:00","id":275231,"title":"","content":"The fun thing about being evil is that no matter what you come up with, chances are Mythology concocted something more obscene. It's pretty much a license to go crazy with exacting &quot;justice&quot; on your enemies!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T06:01:47-07:00","id":275418,"title":"","content":"Yeah, certain old religions had some detestable things going on. Things that could push a good-aligned scion into the arms of a more decent &quot;titan.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.p